<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following production and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for September 09 - September 15  and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		Sep 09-Sept 15		   TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		   1996	 1995	    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Stocks/open    343,469.1	 n/a</p>
<p> Production	37,619.2	 n/a	 395,622.2	 n/a</p>
<p> Shipment	  14,504.1	 n/a	 196,156.9	 n/a</p>
<p> Home Market	  312.6	 n/a	   3,134.3	 n/a</p>
<p> Stocks/close   366,271.6	 n/a</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
